  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html",
  "prefLabel": "He-W 816.02 Eligibility of Qualified Aliens",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 816.02 Eligibility of Qualified Aliens. As long as all other eligibility requirements are met, medical assistance shall be provided to qualified aliens as defined in 8 USC 1641(b), under the following conditions:\n\n(a) The qualified alien entered the United States with a status within the meaning of the term “qualified alien” before August 22, 1996; or\n\n(b) For qualified aliens who enter the United States on or after August 22, 1996, a period of 5 years has elapsed since the date of the alien’s entry into the United States with a status within the meaning of the term “qualified alien.”\n\nSource. #13526, eff 1-24-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
